<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>go-authn – 관리</title><link>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.5/ko/tags/%EA%B4%80%EB%A6%AC/</link><description>Recent content in 관리 on go-authn</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>ko</language><atom:link href="https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.5/ko/tags/%EA%B4%80%EB%A6%AC/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>관리 API, 상태 점검, 메트릭</title><link>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.5/ko/authn-bridge/admin/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.5/ko/authn-bridge/admin/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;둘 다 구성이 요청하지 않으면 꺼져 있으며, 공개 리스너에서는 절대 켜지지 않습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-hcl" data-lang="hcl"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;admin&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt; listen&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;unix:///run/authn-bridge/admin.sock&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # mode 0600
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # or over the network, mutual TLS and nothing less (loopback included):
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # listen = &amp;#34;10.0.0.5:9443&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # tls_cert_file = &amp;#34;/etc/authn-bridge/admin.crt&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # tls_key_file = &amp;#34;/etc/authn-bridge/admin.key&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # client_ca_file = &amp;#34;/etc/authn-bridge/operators-ca.crt&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # reflection = true # for grpcurl; off by default
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;metrics { listen&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;127.0.0.1:9101&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; }&lt;span class="c1"&gt; # /healthz /readyz /metrics
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;disabled_file&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;/var/lib/authn-bridge/disabled.json&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;리스너는 grpc-transports/control의 것이며 go-fileshare와 공유합니다. 소켓은 bind와
chmod 사이에서도 다른 사용자가 접근할 수 없고, 아직 실행 중인 인스턴스에게서
빼앗지도 않습니다. TLS 파일 세 개가 모두 없는 TCP는 루프백을 포함해 거부됩니다.모든 로컬 사용자가 &lt;code&gt;127.0.0.1&lt;/code&gt;에 접근할 수 있기 때문입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;authn-bridge: admin: control: listen address &amp;#34;127.0.0.1:9443&amp;#34; is TCP, which requires mutual TLS (loopback included: any local user can reach it); missing TLSCertFile, TLSKeyFile, ClientCAFile&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;-tags nogrpc&lt;/code&gt;로 빌드한 바이너리에는 관리 API가 없으며, &lt;code&gt;admin&lt;/code&gt; 블록이 있는 구성은
그것 없이 시작하지 않고 거부합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="the-service"&gt;서비스&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="the-service"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#the-service" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 고유 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;bridge.admin.v1.AdminService&lt;/code&gt;(&lt;code&gt;proto/bridge/admin/v1/admin.proto&lt;/code&gt;)와 그 옆의&lt;code&gt;grpc.health.v1&lt;/code&gt;이며, 후자는 공급자가 준비된 동안 &lt;code&gt;SERVING&lt;/code&gt;을 보고합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Status&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;버전, 발급자, 시작 시각, 페더레이션의 메타데이터(IdP, 사용 가능, 유효 기한, 마지막 갱신, 마지막 오류), 메모리에 보유한 것&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;RefreshMetadata&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;지금 페더레이션의 메타데이터를 가져오고 결과를 알려 줌&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;ListIdPs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;기관 목록이 보여 주는 대로의 페더레이션 IdP (&lt;code&gt;query&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;limit&lt;/code&gt;, 기본값 100)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;ListClients&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;구성된 신뢰 당사자&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;RevokePerson&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;그 사람의 리프레시 토큰 계열, 그것으로 얻은 액세스 토큰, 진행 중인 로그인과 디바이스 그랜트, 애플리케이션 비밀번호를 끝내고, 인증서 저장소가 그 사람에 대해 보유한 모든 것(SSH와 X.509 인증서는 다음 KRL과 CRL로, 그리고 WireGuard 키)을 폐기&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;DisablePerson&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;EnablePerson&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;소속 기관이 무엇이라고 하든 로그인과 모든 토큰에서 이 사람을 거부하고, 보유한 것을 폐기함. 선택적으로 &lt;code&gt;until&lt;/code&gt; 시각까지&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;DisableIdP&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;EnableIdP&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;한 기관이 보증하는 모든 사람에 대해 동일하게 함. 메타데이터 갱신으로는 해제되지 않음&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;ListDisabled&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;누가 비활성화되었는지, 이유, 누가 했는지, 언제부터 언제까지인지&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;reflection = true&lt;/code&gt;일 때, 테스트 공급자에 대해:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;$ grpcurl -plaintext -unix $PWD/run/admin.sock bridge.admin.v1.AdminService/Status
{
&amp;#34;version&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;v0.23.3&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;issuer&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;http://127.0.0.1:28473&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;started&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;2026-10-25T18:44:30.210885Z&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;federation&amp;#34;: {
&amp;#34;metadataUrl&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;file:///tmp/authn/fed/metadata.xml&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;idps&amp;#34;: 1,
&amp;#34;usable&amp;#34;: 1,
&amp;#34;validUntil&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;2026-11-01T18:43:40Z&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;lastRefresh&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;2026-10-25T18:44:30.211975Z&amp;#34;
},
&amp;#34;counts&amp;#34;: {}
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="disabling"&gt;비활성화&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="disabling"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#disabling" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 고유 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;$ grpcurl -plaintext -unix -d &amp;#39;{&amp;#34;username&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;alice@univ-example.example&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;reason&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;left the lab&amp;#34;}&amp;#39; $PWD/run/admin.sock bridge.admin.v1.AdminService/DisablePerson
{
&amp;#34;disabled&amp;#34;: {
&amp;#34;username&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;alice@univ-example.example&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;reason&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;left the lab&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;by&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;uid=501&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;since&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;2026-10-11T09:48:39.136975Z&amp;#34;
},
&amp;#34;revoked&amp;#34;: {}
}
$ grpcurl -plaintext -unix -d &amp;#39;{&amp;#34;entity_id&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;https://idp.univ-example.example/idp/shibboleth&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;reason&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;compromised&amp;#34;,&amp;#34;until&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;2026-10-12T08:00:00Z&amp;#34;}&amp;#39; $PWD/run/admin.sock bridge.admin.v1.AdminService/DisableIdP
{
&amp;#34;disabled&amp;#34;: {
&amp;#34;entityId&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;https://idp.univ-example.example/idp/shibboleth&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;reason&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;compromised&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;by&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;uid=501&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;since&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;2026-10-11T09:48:39.192047Z&amp;#34;,
&amp;#34;until&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;2026-10-12T08:00:00Z&amp;#34;
},
&amp;#34;revoked&amp;#34;: {}
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;revoked&lt;/code&gt;는 각 호출이 끝낸 것(리프레시 계열, 액세스 토큰, 로그인, 애플리케이션
비밀번호, 인증서)의 개수이며, 여기서는 살아 있는 것이 없었습니다. 무언가를
바꾸는 모든 호출은 누가 했는지와 함께 기록되며, 소켓에서는 상대방의 &lt;code&gt;uid=&lt;/code&gt;, TLS에서는
클라이언트 인증서의 &lt;code&gt;cn=&lt;/code&gt;입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;disabled alice@univ-example.example (0 known identities) by uid=501 until enabled again: left the lab
revoked alice@univ-example.example: 0 refresh families, 0 access tokens, 0 logins, 0 app passwords, 0 certificates
disabled IdP https://idp.univ-example.example/idp/shibboleth by uid=501 until 2026-10-12T08:00:00Z: compromised
revoked IdP https://idp.univ-example.example/idp/shibboleth: 0 refresh families, 0 access tokens, 0 logins, 0 app passwords, 0 certificates
enabled alice@univ-example.example by uid=501&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;사람은 그가 누구인지로 비활성화됩니다.&lt;/strong&gt; 사용자 이름은 eppn, uid, mail,subject-id가 모두 그렇듯 대소문자 구분 없이 비교되므로,&lt;code&gt;&amp;quot;Alice@Univ-Example.example&amp;quot;&lt;/code&gt;로 같은 호출을 하면 &lt;code&gt;alice@univ-example.example&lt;/code&gt;에
대해 설정한 것이 해제됩니다(&lt;code&gt;{&amp;quot;wasDisabled&amp;quot;: true}&lt;/code&gt;). 항목은 그 이름으로 알려진
모든 사람의 안정적인 신원도 기록하므로, IdP가 다른 표기를 보내더라도 그 사람이
다시 들어올 수 없습니다. &lt;code&gt;@&lt;/code&gt;가 없는 이름은 사용자 이름을 내주지 않는 IdP의 사람을
위해 &lt;code&gt;sub&lt;/code&gt;로도 일치시킵니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;항목은 무엇이든 폐기하기 &lt;strong&gt;전에&lt;/strong&gt; 기록되므로, 폐기와 경쟁하는 그랜트는 그 항목을
만나게 됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;비활성화는 &lt;code&gt;disabled_file&lt;/code&gt;에 보관되며, 없으면 거부됩니다.&lt;/strong&gt; 다음 재시작까지만
비활성화된 사람은 다음 배포 때 다시 들어오게 될 것입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;$ grpcurl -plaintext -unix -d &amp;#39;{&amp;#34;username&amp;#34;:&amp;#34;alice@univ-example.example&amp;#34;}&amp;#39; $PWD/run/admin.sock bridge.admin.v1.AdminService/DisablePerson
ERROR:
Code: FailedPrecondition
Message: disabling needs disabled_file in the configuration: without it, a restart would forget who is disabled&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;읽을 수 없는 파일은 같은 이유로 공급자가 시작하지 못하게 합니다. 비활성화된 기관은&lt;code&gt;Status&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ListIdPs&lt;/code&gt;,&lt;a href="https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.5/ko/authn-bridge/configuration/#check-before-a-restart"&gt;&lt;code&gt;check&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;에서
사용 불가로 집계됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;비활성화가 공급자 밖으로 미치는 범위는&lt;a href="https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.5/ko/authn-bridge/revocation/"&gt;폐기&lt;/a&gt;에 있습니다. 인증서는 KRL과
CRL, 토큰은 Shared Signals입니다. 여기서 제거한 애플리케이션 비밀번호는
go-fileshare가 다음에 디렉터리를 읽을 때 동작하지 않게 되며, 즉시 효과가 나게 하려면&lt;code&gt;DisablePerson&lt;/code&gt; 뒤에 그 &lt;code&gt;ReloadDirectory&lt;/code&gt;를 호출하십시오.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:overflow-x-auto hx:mt-6 hx:flex hx:rounded-lg hx:border hx:py-2 hx:ltr:pr-4 hx:rtl:pl-4 hx:contrast-more:border-current hx:contrast-more:dark:border-current hx:border-amber-200 hx:bg-amber-100 hx:text-amber-900 hx:dark:border-amber-200/30 hx:dark:bg-amber-900/30 hx:dark:text-amber-200"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:ltr:pl-3 hx:ltr:pr-2 hx:rtl:pr-3 hx:rtl:pl-2"&gt;&lt;svg height=1.2em class="hx:inline-block hx:align-middle" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:w-full hx:min-w-0 hx:leading-7"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:mt-6 hx:leading-7 hx:first:mt-0"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;RevokePerson&lt;/code&gt;이 끝낼 수 없는 것&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이미 전달된 액세스 토큰은 리소스 서버가 스스로 확인하는 서명된 진술이며, 그곳에서
만료될 때까지(기본값은 한 시간) 유효합니다. 이미 발급된 SSH 인증서는 서버가 KRL을
읽지 않으면 유효 기간 동안 유지되며, 그래서 둘 다 수명이 짧습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="health-and-metrics"&gt;상태 점검과 메트릭&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="health-and-metrics"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#health-and-metrics" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 고유 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;go-net-health/endpoint의 것으로 go-fileshare와 같으며, &lt;code&gt;metrics&lt;/code&gt; 리스너에 있습니다.이 리스너는 공개 리스너여서는 안 됩니다(그렇게 만드는 구성은 거부됩니다).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;/healthz&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;프로세스가 응답하는 동안 up&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;/readyz&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;페더레이션의 메타데이터가 로드되어 &lt;code&gt;validUntil&lt;/code&gt; 이내이고, 상태 데이터베이스에 도달하기를 기다리는 폐기가 없는 동안 ready&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;/metrics&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Prometheus 텍스트, &lt;code&gt;bridge_*&lt;/code&gt; 계열&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;$ curl -s http://127.0.0.1:28475/metrics | grep &amp;#34;^bridge_&amp;#34;
bridge_build_info{version=&amp;#34;v0.23.3&amp;#34;,goversion=&amp;#34;go1.27.3&amp;#34;,revision=&amp;#34;b04769c43c24f684df9e0b5a0d1cb6997ee90d95&amp;#34;} 1
bridge_start_time_seconds 1792953870
bridge_ready 1
bridge_metadata_valid_until_timestamp_seconds 1793558620
bridge_metadata_idps 1
bridge_metadata_last_refresh_timestamp_seconds 1792953870
bridge_metadata_refreshes_total{result=&amp;#34;failed&amp;#34;} 0
bridge_metadata_refreshes_total{result=&amp;#34;ok&amp;#34;} 1
bridge_logins_in_progress 0
bridge_devices_waiting 0
bridge_refresh_families 0
bridge_access_tokens 0
bridge_disabled{kind=&amp;#34;idp&amp;#34;} 0
bridge_disabled{kind=&amp;#34;person&amp;#34;} 0
bridge_ssh_certificates_total 0
bridge_x509_certificates_total 0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;결과별 로그인 카운터(&lt;code&gt;bridge_logins_total&lt;/code&gt;), 그랜트별 토큰 카운터(&lt;code&gt;bridge_tokens_issued_total&lt;/code&gt;), 애플리케이션 비밀번호 카운터(&lt;code&gt;bridge_app_passwords_total&lt;/code&gt;)는 무언가를 집계한 뒤에야 나타납니다. &lt;strong&gt;어떤 레이블도
사람이나 기관의 이름을 담지 않습니다.&lt;/strong&gt; 어느 대학의 사람들이 서비스를 언제
사용하는지는 공급자가 공개할 일이 아닙니다. &lt;code&gt;bridge_metadata_valid_until_timestamp_seconds&lt;/code&gt;가
알려 주는 시각에 도달하기 전에 경보를 설정하십시오. 그 시각이 지나면 아무도
로그인할 수 없습니다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>